<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kids Waiting for a Sponsor — Roc Solid Foundation</title>
<link href="https://fonts.bunny.net/css?family=source-sans-3:400,600,700" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --navy: #004270;
    --blue: #0378ad;
    --light-blue: #d0e8f5;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --ff: 'Franklin Gothic Medium', 'Source Sans 3', Arial Narrow, sans-serif;
  }

  html, body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--navy);
    font-family: var(--ff);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  /* Subtle grain texture */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.75' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .page {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 64px;
  }

  /* Header */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    animation: fadeUp .6s ease forwards;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .headline {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }

  .headline span {
    color: var(--light-blue);
  }

  .subline {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
    max-width: 480px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Map container */
  .map-wrap {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp .7s .25s ease forwards;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(3,120,173,.25);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    background: #002d4d;
  }

  iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 680px;
    border: none;
  }

  /* Footer note */
  .footer-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.3);
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp .6s .4s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page { padding: 32px 16px 48px; }
    iframe { height: 420px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Roc Solid Foundation</p>
    <h1 class="headline">Kids Waiting for<br><span>a Sponsor</span></h1>
    <p class="subline">Every pin on the map is a child fighting cancer who needs your help. Click any pin to learn more.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="map-wrap">
    <iframe
      src="https://chuckandcharley.github.io/sponsor-map"
      scrolling="no"
      title="Roc Solid Foundation Sponsor Map">
    </iframe>
  </div>

  <p class="footer-note">Map updates automatically every day &nbsp;·&nbsp; Roc Solid Foundation</p>

</div>
</body>
</html>
